    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Why do you have to know my free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:56:04.254491+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure! My free time is pretty busy, but I could probably pick you up around 2 pm. What about you? Any plans for the evening?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:56:35.229366+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry, that's too bad. I wasn't sure if you were busy for dinner.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:58:10.104343+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, I'm sorry, that's too bad. It must have been hard to plan things around your schedule, especially for dinner! Let me know what works best for you when we go out.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T21:59:43.545668+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I understand that planning a dinner date can be challenging. Would you like me to book a table for us?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:03:02.061241+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Sure, I'd be happy to book a table for us.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:04:15.457646+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That sounds great, I can look it up right now. Is there a certain time you would like the reservation to be made?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:08:55.396518+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Perfect, thanks! I can book a table for us at 2 pm. Let me know the reservation details and any special instructions.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:10:18.049729+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you so much for the offer!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-16T22:12:57.062373+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
